---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import ClaimBlock from '../components/ClaimBlock.astro';
import { release, url } from '../lib/publication';
const entries = [
  ['C-IMD-RAINFALL-DEP-india-20260923','Observed rainfall through 23 September 2026'],
  ['C-KA-DROUGHT-ORDER-20260922','Karnataka gazetted drought declaration, 22 September 2026'],
  ['C-CWC-INDIA-STORAGE-20260910','CWC monitored-reservoir storage, 10 September 2026'],
  ['C-IMD-OUTLOOK-20260831','Forecast issued 31 August; valid for September 2026'],
  ['C-JJM-FUNDS-20260331','Ministry release of 31 March 2026'],
  ['C-JJM-CONNECTIONS-20260303','Connection status as of 3 March 2026'],
] as const;
---
<Site title="Dated updates" description="A source-linked sequence of approved observations and reports, with event and publication dates kept apart.">
  <PageHeader title="What entered the record" eyebrow="Updates · evidence desk" description="This is a curated evidence log, not a live news wire. The date on each item says what the source actually covers." />
  <section class="section"><div class="shell page-grid"><article><p>Our newest approved rainfall observation is IMD's graphic through <strong>23 September 2026</strong>. A separate <a href={url('/sources/E-KA-GAZETTE-DROUGHT-20260922/')}>22 September Karnataka gazette</a> declared 53 additional taluks drought-affected for the 2026 kharif season; it does not establish relief delivery or measured crop loss. The <a href={url('/sources/E-CWC-RSMS-20260910/')}>CWC storage bulletin</a> is dated 10 September, for 178 monitored reservoirs, and cannot establish storage at the later rainfall cutoff. The March programme and connection records describe earlier administrative periods. The 31 August IMD item is a forecast for September 2026, subject to any later issue; it is not an observed September result. Links below lead to exact source records and limitations.</p>
    {entries.map(([id,heading]) => {const claim = release.claims.find(c => c.id === id); return claim && <ClaimBlock claim={claim} heading={heading} />})}
    <div class="note"><strong>Changes since the last release</strong><p>No earlier approved publication snapshot with matched definitions is bound to this build. We therefore cannot calculate a reliable “since last update” change from these different records. A future revision will retain both versions and identify changed claims.</p></div>
  </article><aside><p class="eyebrow">Inspect the record</p><a href={url('/data-status/')}>Coverage and freshness</a><a href={url('/sources/')}>Source catalogue</a><a href={url('/corrections/')}>Corrections</a><a href={url('/journalists/')}>Reuse the data</a></aside></div></section>
</Site>
